    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc01_0130_sister_12",
      "hash64": "05D81C9DE4B200F8",
      "text": "Niente male, no? Rende tutta l’atmosfera\\ndella festa.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc01_0130_sister_04",
      "hash64": "05DBA09DE4B5171B",
      "text": "Non so se lo sai già, ma questa festa si tiene\\nin onore dei tre [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]beniamici[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
